## Counting from 0:  this project's lists start at 0 (its project file)
// Numbers count from 0;  ordinal words don't change.  Its deck is the cards library's:  ace of clubs first.
to test counting from zero
	the deck is a new deck
	the name of card 0 of the deck should be "ace-of-clubs"
	the name of card 1 of the deck should be "ace-of-diamonds"
	the name of card -1 of the deck should be "king-of-spades"
	the name of the first card of the deck should be "ace-of-clubs"
	the name of the second card of the deck should be "ace-of-diamonds"
	the name of the last card of the deck should be "king-of-spades"
	set the ace to the first card of the deck
	the position of the ace in the deck should be 0
	set the aces to cards 0 to 3 of the deck
	the number of cards in the aces should be 4
	the name of the last card of the aces should be "ace-of-spades"
	set the kings to last two cards of the deck
	the number of cards in the kings should be 2
	the name of the first card of the kings should be "king-of-hearts"
	set the positions to a new list of numbers
	for each card, position in the aces
		add position to the positions
	echo "positions: " + the positions
	remove card 0 of the deck
	the name of the first card of the deck should be "ace-of-diamonds"
